BlackHole
---------

Jumphertz sends audio to BlackHole (https://github.com/ExistentialAudio/BlackHole), a virtual audio driver by
Existential Audio Inc., licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. BlackHole is NOT included in or
distributed with Jumphertz: users install it separately (for example with `brew install blackhole-2ch`).
Jumphertz only uses it as an ordinary audio device through Apple's CoreAudio API.
